event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":95,"item_id":"rs_03f11f0a7fad75a4016acd224377d88193ba7983fa0475ba10","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Evaluating positions table management**\n\nI need to decide whether to keep the sort_order cache for my positions table or remove it entirely. I want to ensure that each project maintains a unique position. When migrating, I should insert any missing current tasks at the start, using a safe, transactional approach to avoid ghost entries. The wrapper function for transactions needs to be generic. I’ll initialize from the sort_order ranks and ensure that new creations obtain their position before insertion, all without async operations."}

